 "edge_runtime_isolate_churn": "In the last v3 on-arm run (52 rps, ~95 s of container life) the edge runtime logged 33 'CPU time soft limit reached' and 49 'early termination has been triggered' (retire) events, plus 16 wall-clock warnings: under overload a function's isolate is replaced every few seconds, so in-isolate limiter state (counts and key-to-tenant hints) restarts at zero while the retiring isolate still drains its own admitted requests.",
